invalid type: string "to be Accredited taxes as applicable (Amount in Rupees)\n1 1,00,000 + Taxes\n2 1,50,000 + Taxes\n3 2,00,000 + Taxes\n4 2,50,000 + Taxes\n5 3,00,000 + Taxes\nMode of Payment\nThe institution may pay the fee (Registration/Accreditation) by the following modes:\ni. Net Banking\nii. Credit/ Debit Card\niii. NEFT/RTGS as per the details given below:-\ntional Board of Accreditation